✔️ Max = best future possibility
✔️ Diagonal = match
✔️ Up = ignore str1 char
✔️ Left = ignore str2 char
✔️ SCS = combine both with minimum repeat
✔️ Reverse at end
💥 5 Interview Questions + Answers
1. ❓ LCS me max kyu lete hain?

👉 Kyuki hume longest subsequence chahiye
👉 max = better answer

2. ❓ SCS aur LCS relation kya hai?

👉 Formula:

SCS length = n + m − LCS
3. ❓ Why diagonal in match?

👉 Kyuki:

ek char match hua
dono strings me move → i-1, j-1
4. ❓ Backtracking me dp ka use kyu?

👉 Direction decide karne ke liye:

kaunsa path better hai
5. ❓ Time Complexity?

👉 DP fill: O(n * m)
👉 Backtrack: O(n + m)

